{"id":"n62251-2-2","stage":0,"title":"그거 · 那个","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62251-2-2-1","ko":"손님, 이 제품 한번 보세요. 이번에 새로 나왔어요.","zh":"顾客您好，请看看这款产品。这是刚推出的新货哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"손님,","meaning":"客人，顾客","explanation":"손님：客人，顾客。","readings":[{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71279","senseId":"2","lemma":"손님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"손님","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"제품","meaning":"产品，制品","explanation":"제품：产品，制品。","readings":[{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70898","senseId":"1","lemma":"제품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제품","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下。","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}},{"text":"보세요.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보세요","audio":"/audio/10b2f8c9f190884edd75.mp3"}},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"새로","meaning":"新","explanation":"새로：新。","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"1","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}},{"text":"나왔어요.","meaning":"上市，出品","explanation":"나오다：上市，出品；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"6","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나왔어요","audio":"/audio/9c894cf2b8ccb1afceae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3324c7e0bb86f28d","term":"손님","zh":"客人，顾客","audio":"/audio/3324c7e0bb86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"60be380dfd52bdfe","term":"제품","zh":"产品，制品","audio":"/audio/60be380dfd52bdfeffe2.mp3","entryId":"70898","definition":"使用材料制作物品；或指经此做出来的物品。","pronunciation":["제ː품"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"从前没有而首次。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"上市，出品","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"新商品出现在市场上。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d932f42daf44543f3343.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62251-2-2-2","ko":"좋아 보이네요. 그거 얼마예요?","zh":"看起来不错呢。那款要多少钱？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋아","audio":"/audio/03b87f7121c91d1c28e1.mp3"}},{"text":"보이네요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이네요","audio":"/audio/46898c8efbf3b62488a4.mp3"}},{"text":"그거","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그거：那个。","readings":[{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62251","senseId":"2","lemma":"그거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그거","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3"}},{"text":"얼마예요?","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"얼마예요","audio":"/audio/74f61b058b435e5ecaf9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"4e2a8844f69b923d","term":"그거","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/4e2a8844f69b923decca.mp3","entryId":"62251","definition":"指代前面已提到过的对象。","pronunciation":["그거"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]}],"audio":"/audio/95bf3a788751f18adb37.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.068,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62251","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":29,"sequenceScore":1.2841,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["顾客您好，请看看这款产品。这是刚推出的新货哦。","看起来不错呢。那款要多少钱？","智秀，你今年几岁了？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["顾客您好，请看看这款产品。这是刚推出的新货哦。","看起来不错呢。那款要多少钱？","智秀，你今年几岁了？"],"answer":1}]}
